{"canonical_quiz_id":"music-people-20261011","mapping_version":"legacy-choice/v1","questions":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-001","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-001-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-001-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-001-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-001-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall называет Арету Франклин первой женщиной, введённой в зал; её индукция состоялась в 1987 году.","source_id":"music-people-001"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-002","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-002-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-002-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-002-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-002-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall указывает Mississippi Goddamn среди записей альбома Nina Simone in Concert, выпущенного в 1964 году.","source_id":"music-people-002"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-003","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-003-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-003-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-003-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-003-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall связывает Bohemian Rhapsody с альбомом A Night at the Opera 1975 года.","source_id":"music-people-003"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-004","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-004-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-004-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-004-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-004-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall называет Keep Yourself Alive первой песней дебютного альбома Queen и отмечает, что её написал Брайан Мэй.","source_id":"music-people-004"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-005","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-005-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-005-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-005-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-005-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall пишет, что в 1973 году Партон завершила семилетнее партнёрство с Портером Вагонером и написала I Will Always Love You как прощальный подарок.","source_id":"music-people-005"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-006","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-006-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-006-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-006-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-006-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Официальная биография Фицджеральд рассказывает, что на Amateur Night она планировала танцевать, но перед выходом решила петь.","source_id":"music-people-006"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-007","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-007-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-007-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-007-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-007-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Официальная биография указывает, что в 1938 году Фицджеральд записала A-Tisket, A-Tasket; запись стала хитом и продержалась в поп-чартах 17 недель.","source_id":"music-people-007"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-008","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-008-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-008-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-008-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-008-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"На странице Rock Hall указано, что Боба Дилана в 1988 году ввёл Брюс Спрингстин.","source_id":"music-people-008"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-009","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-009-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-009-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-009-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-009-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall указывает 1996 год индукции Дэвида Боуи; его представлял Дэвид Бирн.","source_id":"music-people-009"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-010","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-010-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-010-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-010-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-010-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Страница Rock Hall указывает, что Билли Холидей в 2000 году представила Диана Росс.","source_id":"music-people-010"}],"source_category":"Музыка","source_description":"Десять вопросов о певцах, авторах и записях с первичными музейными и официальными источниками.","source_path":"quizzes/MusicPeople/music_people_20261011.json","source_quiz_id":"music-people-20261011","source_sha256":"a39ceb3e249bd119b16d7716bd3ac7eda1068e05854a983fb13e31e6f1b72230","source_title":"Музыка: голоса и записи"}
